アンダーライブのおいシャンの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Aメロは注目よ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/07/25/4710184/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"6月27日の横浜個別握手会！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1部から3部！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/07/25/4710184/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1部の髪型と洋服！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さしてるピン留めは未央奈からの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パリのお土産♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"塩アイスで色違いです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/07/25/4710184/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前髪同じで髪の毛巻き！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"洋服は妹のオーバーオールに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Tシャツ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/07/25/4710184/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"三部は、大人っぽく！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一つで結って、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"紺色のワンピースに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ネックレスしました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/07/25/4710184/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"16日には、伊織と純奈と3人でディズニーにいって17日に私の家でお泊まりして伊織は18日も泊まって一緒にダンスの練習したんだ～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ディズニーでは、テンションMAXになったりで純奈のチークでみんなのほっぺをハート型にチークいれたり、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アトラクションで予想以上にびしょびしょになったり、車を運転できる乗り物で私だけ真剣にハンドルきったり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とっても楽しかったです♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またいこうね♪能條さん方といくディズニーも、まだ行けてないのではやくいきたーい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/07/25/4710184/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、京都での全国握手会！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミニライブがなく、皆さんにはがっかりさせてしまいごめんなさい。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少しでも楽しんでもらえるようにと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"トークやカラオケをしたりと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会場もわいわいしてましたね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ペアはまりかさん♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/07/25/4710184/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"がうっちを食らうがおー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛すぎて食べられませんが♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや、逆に可愛すぎるから食べちゃいたい♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/07/25/4710184/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかさんの手にラクガキしてから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分の手にもラクガキしました♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかさんとの握手楽しかった♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また機会があったら、その時はまりかさんの手にバージョンアップしたラクガキするぞ(灬ºωº灬)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかさんのファンの方ありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/07/25/4710184/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、21日に気づいたら片想いラストの個別握手会がありました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はじめての4部でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1部はショートパンツにTシャツみたいなトップスに髪型がストレート！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2部がさくらんぼの絵柄のワンピースに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪型がストレート！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3部がさくらんぼの絵柄のワンピースに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まきがみ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5部が襟付きのトップスにミディ丈スカートに髪型は巻き髪のおんぷちゃんヘアでリボンつけました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/07/25/4710184/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5部！このトップスあしゅさんと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おそろっち♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてこの日は2部終わりに私の生誕祭がありました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/07/25/4710184/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やるよーってちょっと風の噂で聞いてたけど本当にあるのかなー？って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"当日も皆さん何も言わないから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なさそうだな～なんて思って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少し不安だったけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちゃんと生誕祭を開いて下さいました♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛く装飾して下さったレーンを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"歩いて行く前から"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"照れて照れて大変でした。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生誕委員の方々がたくさんたくさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私のためにしてくださり、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんの方が集まってくれていました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"登場曲がロマンスのスタートだったのですが、ロマンスのスタートは私が初めて入った選抜の曲でもあって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうひとつ理由があることをファンの方に教えてもらいました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、その理由はなんだか照れくさいし大切な思いが込められているので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"秘密にしておきます♡笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/07/25/4710184/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2.3部の洋服！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"未央奈と純奈が私のために手紙を読んでくれました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その手紙はとても未央奈らしくて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"純奈らしくて、2人の思いは全部私まで届きました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"未央奈もブログで言ってるとおり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近はコミュニケーションがとれてなくて、距離ができていました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それは私も感じていて、でもその距離にはたくさんの理由があって、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"未央奈もそれは感じていたんだなって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その時知ったよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二期生1人で選抜の中にいて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大変なこともある